  "_readme": [
    "Canonical NCERT chapter list for NEET. This file is the single fixed list that",
    "extracted chapter names are normalised against - edit it here, never in code.",
    "",
    "VERIFY THIS AGAINST THE CURRENT NTA SYLLABUS BEFORE TRUSTING THE PLANNER.",
    "NTA rationalised the syllabus in 2024 and dropped several chapters. Questions",
    "from 2015-2019 papers may sit in chapters no longer examinable, which matters:",
    "the planner must not send a student to study a chapter that cannot appear.",
    "Chapters believed dropped are marked \"in_current_syllabus\": false.",
    "",
    "The botany/zoology split is a COACHING CONVENTION, not an NCERT one. NCERT",
    "publishes one Biology book; NTA splits the paper into Botany 45 and Zoology 45",
    "but does not publish a per-chapter mapping, and institutes disagree on several.",
    "Chapters where the split is genuinely contested carry \"split_disputed\": true.",
    "Getting these wrong shifts marks between two 45-question papers, so check the",
    "disputed ones against how your student's school or coaching centre teaches it."
  ],

